High priority:

- Chat bugs
 - If I am typing a message and then hit the Up key, the current message is replaced with a previous message from the message history. There is no way to get back to the message I was typing -- it is gone. There should be a way to go back to what I was typing, or perhaps simply not going back into chat history if there is anything entered into the entry field already.
 - Once there is enough text to scroll in xtext, the last line gets cut off, even after scrolling all the way down.

